adaptation-samsung-gts7xlwifi (0.0.1+git20260527125500.0000000.trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial adaptation package for Samsung Galaxy Tab S7+ Wi-Fi (SM-T970,
    codename gts7xlwifi), forked from ArchieMeng's adaptation-sony-pdx206.
  * Rename all sony-pdx206 paths and identifiers to samsung-gts7xlwifi.
  * Rename udev rules file 70-pdx206.rules -> 70-gts7xlwifi.rules (contents
    are generic Halium/Qualcomm sm8250 permissions; no device-specific
    binding required at this stage).
  * Tune etc/phosh/phoc.ini for the 12.4" 2800x1752 tablet panel.
  * Remove ArchieMeng's apt-repo GPG keyring (will be replaced by a
    mukahraman-signed key once our own apt repo is wired up).
  * Stop blanket-ignoring debian/ in .gitignore so future package files
    don't silently disappear.

